Create a tightly bound matter wall of up to a length of 3 that lasts 4 turns.

If any part of this wall is dug out it will explode, causing targets in a radius of [1, 1, 1, 1, 2 (TL1-5; PARADOX 300)] to bleed for [121, 163, 195, 223, 247 (TL1-5; SP 100; PARADOX 300)] physical damage over six turns.
